WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.160
We found a lot of these children,

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.880
and we're sending them back,

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.200
and we've been sending them back to their parents.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.560
They said, nobody knows who they are.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:09.840
They said, where do you come from?

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.840
And they'll give us a country, and we'll find out,

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.960
and we'll figure it out, and we'll bring them back to their home.

